sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario
    participant B as Browser
    participant Q as Fila local
    participant S as Express demo-access
    participant M as Maps processo
    U->>B: Abre login
    B->>Q: GET session
    Q->>S: session + cookie
    S-->>B: csrf + anonymous
    U->>B: Envia adm e senha
    B->>Q: login serializado
    Q->>S: POST login + header CSRF
    S->>M: Cria sessao 30 min
    S-->>B: ok + cookie opaco
    B->>S: Le session novamente
    S-->>B: authenticated scope demo_only
    B-->>U: Monta shell e DemoStore
    U->>B: Sair
    B->>Q: logout serializado
    Q->>S: POST logout + CSRF
    S->>M: Revoga sessao
    S-->>B: ok + cookies limpos
